uplink-sunrise-virology-grenade-name = Biohazard canister
uplink-sunrise-virology-grenade-desc = Releases infectious aerosol carrying a nonlethal strain: coughing, weakness, fatigue and tremors. Carriers keep spreading the infection after the haze disperses. Internals only halve the risk inside the cloud; a gas mask or a sealed bio suit protects completely.
disease-syndicate-haze-name = aerosol syndrome
disease-syndicate-haze-description = A highly contagious engineered virus. Causes temporary weakness, fatigue and tremors without organ damage, and gradually clears on its own.
disease-symptom-haze-tremor = tremors
disease-claim-suppresses-haze-tremor = suppresses tremors
disease-claim-unstable-with-haze-tremor = unstable with tremors
